                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h3]Childhood Memories[/h3]\n[b]METAL SLUG 2[/b] is one of my favorite entries in the series, and playing it again brought back so many memories from my childhood, when I used to play these games on arcade machines. There's something special about returning to a game that was part of those years and discovering that it can still make you smile just as much.\n\n[h3]Classic Arcade Action[/h3]\nThe gameplay is everything I love about the series: frantic action, crazy weapons, huge explosions and enemies coming at you from every direction. The detailed sprites, funny animations and over-the-top situations give the game a unique personality that has aged remarkably well. Playing solo, I found the difficulty challenging but satisfying, making every victory feel earned.\n\n[h3]Final Thoughts[/h3]\nI completed [b]METAL SLUG 2[/b] 100% in 3.5 hours, and I had a fantastic time revisiting this classic. It's not just about the action itself, but also about the memories attached to it. For me, this game is a wonderful reminder of the excitement of arcade machines and the simple joy of gaming during childhood.\n\nSome games never really lose their magic. This is definitely one of them ❤️",
